msgid "The Chefs"
msgstr "Chefs"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-chefs/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> A group of cooks, dietitians, and teachers are tasked with both creating and promoting well-rounded and tasty vegetarian cuisine in a world living through the culture shock of no affordable meat.\n"
msgstr "> Un grupo de cocineres, dietistas y docentes crean y promueven menús de cocina vegetariana sabrosos y completos, en un mundo que atraviesa el shock cultural de la subida inasumible del precio de la carne.\n"

