#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/seeds/the-community-center/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Community Center"
msgstr "El Centro Comunitario"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-community-center/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> A community center, library, or educational hub, initially set up to help people like coal miners re-specialize and find other jobs, has now became a place for unofficial “pilgrimages” of people striving to find their role in life and learn history from those who lived it.\n"
msgstr "> Un centro comunitario o biblioteca, inicialmente ideado para ayudar a personal de la industria minera a especializarse en otras áreas o buscar alternativas laborales. En la actualidad, reconvertido en un centro de \"peregrinaje\" para gente que busca su rol en la vida y aprende la historia de quienes transitaron por el mismo camino incierto.\n"

