#, no-wrap
msgid "The Epidemiologists"
msgstr "Epidemiólogues"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-epidemiologists/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> A collective of doctors, epidemiologists, and educators is researching new pandemic threats and trying to convince multiple communities that they need to vaccinate and change their behaviors without using violence or direct power.\n"
msgstr "> Un colectivo de personal sanitario, epidemiólogues y docentes investigan nuevas amenazas de pandemia y educan a las comunidades sobre vacunación y prevención, sin ejercer violencia u opresión contra la gente a la que orientan.\n"

